588
02:00:36,778 --> 02:00:39,478
もうどうなってもいいや
I don't care what happens anymore.

589
02:00:40,178 --> 02:00:42,278
まさか負荷に落ちていた無重力
Unbelievably, the zero gravity fallen into gravity,

590
