ピント合わしてフォーカス
focus, aligning the lens.

598
02:01:19,278 --> 02:01:22,278
ピント外れの真実のそばに居れたらそれだけで
Beside the out-of-focus truth, if I could just be there, with only that,

599
02:01:22,278 --> 02:01:25,278
黒と白の街が滲むんだ 簡単じゃないから もっと
the black and white city bleeds, because it's not simple, more!

600
02:01:25,278 --> 02:01:28,778
クローバー 頭空け立つように 1、2の3で
Clover, as if clearing my head, on the count of one, two, three,

601
02:01:28,778 --> 02:01:32,278
魔法みたいな強いもの そんなもの無くたって...
something strong like magic, even without such a thing,

602
02:01:32,278 --> 02:01:36,078
諦めたってのはもうバッドエンド 最後の勇気を
giving up is already a bad end, the final courage...

603
02:01:36,078 --> 02:01:38,778
もうどうなってもいいや
I don't care what happens anymore.

604
02:01:41,778 --> 02:01:45,278
火花みたいに燃えた証
The proof that burned like sparks,

605
02:01:45,278 --> 02:01:48,778
いつの日か忘れちゃった
I forgot it someday.

606
02:01:49,278 --> 02:01:55,778
叶わないなんて感情を絞り挟んで特別になるんだろう
Squeezing in the feeling of not being able to fulfill it, will I become special?

607
02:01:56,278 --> 02:02:00,278
もっと手を繋がせて 静寂とトワイライト飛行
Let me hold your hand more, silence and twilight flight.

608
02:02:01,278 --> 02:02:04,278
深く深り 距離まで引き寄せた
Deeply deepening, drawn close to the distance,

609
02:02:05,178 --> 02:02:08,778
月の涙が降ったこの世はまるでstranger
the tears of the moon fell, this world is just like a stranger,

610
02:02:08,778 --> 02:02:11,778
相棒 叫べ
partner, scream!

611
02:02:12,778 --> 02:02:16,278
まさか負荷に落ちていた無重力 ミッドナイト飛行
Unbelievably, the zero gravity fallen into gravity, a midnight flight.

612
02:02:16,778 --> 02:02:20,078
秘密の中で交わって飛ぼう
Let's meet and fly in the secret.

613
02:02:20,778 --> 02:02:24,278
kissで最後まで持って行って マスコットたちの足音が
Keep it up with a kiss until the end, the mascot's footsteps...

614
02:02:24,278 --> 02:02:27,778
交じり合う星に追い果て
chasing to the end of the intersecting stars.

615
02:02:28,278 --> 02:02:33,278
正義が嫌いだなんてこの世はすべて終わった相棒さ
Saying you hate justice, this world is completely finished, partner.

616
