痛みを見ないと気付けやしないんだ
If I don't see the pain, I won't even realize it.

622
02:03:34,278 --> 02:03:37,278
ああ今日も絡めるペイン
Ah, entwined pain again today...

623
02:03:46,278 --> 02:03:49,278
いい子でなきゃ いられないよ だって
Because I can't stay if I'm not a good child,

624
02:03:49,278 --> 02:03:52,778
世界はこんなにも大き彩りで
since the world has such a grand array of colors.

625
